Khalifah al-Tunaiji
Recitation audio, verse by verse (Hafs ʿan ʿĀṣim, murattal).

Source: EveryAyah, https://everyayah.com
Verse files as published by EveryAyah; re-encoded by siyak-data to mono MP3 at
64 kbit/s. The recitation itself is unchanged.

The recordings are the copyright of the reciter and of the recording's producer. No
license is stated by EveryAyah. Siyak redistributes them with attribution for
personal, non-commercial listening, and removes this pack at the rights holder's
request: https://github.com/siyak-app/siyak-data/issues

